{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014cHUbGgC1a2VWTJ22SV4Xk","type":"tool_result","content":"53-\n54-## Live-eval checkpoints\n55-\n56-`python -m evals.live` writes a resumable checkpoint (`logs/eval/live-<timestamp>.json`)\n57:after each trial. A saved checkpoint may be **resumed only when its report format\n58-version, its contract version, its model and its stage all match the current run, and\n59-the saved case selection still exists** (`evals/live.py`); any mismatch starts a fresh\n60-run rather than silently continuing under different terms. This is distinct from the\n61-contract hash pin (ADR-008) and the SDK+framework pin (ADR-015-3) — see `RUNBOOK.md` §1."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50712efd-ac4a-4540-b086-5dbc582bfb74","uuid":"33c9f0fe-f713-4a01-b35f-2056c7bee51e","timestamp":"2026-09-29T08:04:48.403Z","tool_use_result":{"mode":"content","numFiles":0,"filenames":[],"content":"53-\n54-## Live-eval checkpoints\n55-\n56-`python -m evals.live` writes a resumable checkpoint (`logs/eval/live-<timestamp>.json`)\n57:after each trial. A saved checkpoint may be **resumed only when its report format\n58-version, its contract version, its model and its stage all match the current run, and\n59-the saved case selection still exists** (`evals/live.py`); any mismatch starts a fresh\n60-run rather than silently continuing under different terms. This is distinct from the\n61-contract hash pin (ADR-008) and the SDK+framework pin (ADR-015-3) — see `RUNBOOK.md` §1.","numLines":9,"totalLines":9}}
