{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PyU2WQD7JzcGJFvv1WuYVE","type":"tool_result","content":"85\t  --case answer/VC-POC-04 \\\n86\t  --max-trials 3\n87\t```\n88\t\n89\tContinue the same checkpoint in a later account window using the path printed\n90\tby the runner:\n91\t\n92\t```bash\n93\t.venv/bin/python -m evals.live --resume logs/eval/live-<timestamp>.json --max-trials 3\n94\t```\n95\t\n96\t**Checkpoint compatibility (`evals/live.py`).** A resume is accepted only when the\n97\tsaved checkpoint's report format version, contract version, model and stage all\n98\tmatch the current invocation, and the saved case selection still exists; any\n99\tmismatch is refused rather than silently continued under different terms. This is\n100\tthe referent for \"checkpoint compatibility\" in this repo — distinct from the\n101\tcontract hash pin (ADR-008, §2 below) and from the per-model cache-minimum\n102\tre-verification on a model upgrade (ADR-006). Changing `CLAUDE_ACCOUNT_MODEL`\n103\ttherefore starts a new checkpoint rather than resuming an old one, per §1 above.\n104\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"50712efd-ac4a-4540-b086-5dbc582bfb74","uuid":"b82747db-7cc3-43f6-9c8f-d16866487da9","timestamp":"2026-09-29T08:04:56.157Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/shane/Projects/k-12Harness/RUNBOOK.md","content":"  --case answer/VC-POC-04 \\\n  --max-trials 3\n```\n\nContinue the same checkpoint in a later account window using the path printed\nby the runner:\n\n```bash\n.venv/bin/python -m evals.live --resume logs/eval/live-<timestamp>.json --max-trials 3\n```\n\n**Checkpoint compatibility (`evals/live.py`).** A resume is accepted only when the\nsaved checkpoint's report format version, contract version, model and stage all\nmatch the current invocation, and the saved case selection still exists; any\nmismatch is refused rather than silently continued under different terms. This is\nthe referent for \"checkpoint compatibility\" in this repo — distinct from the\ncontract hash pin (ADR-008, §2 below) and from the per-model cache-minimum\nre-verification on a model upgrade (ADR-006). Changing `CLAUDE_ACCOUNT_MODEL`\ntherefore starts a new checkpoint rather than resuming an old one, per §1 above.\n","numLines":20,"startLine":85,"totalLines":242}}}
